IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `tpa-termination`

-- Termination of Pregnancy Act 1974, ss 3, 4, 5, 6, 7 and 10 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_termination-of-pregnancy-act-1974.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

